<title>USA: Texas $59 mln housing bonds yield six pct in 2017.</title>
<headline>Texas $59 mln housing bonds yield six pct in 2017.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>John Nuveen &amp; Co Inc said Wednesday it tentatively priced $59.1 million Texas Department of Housing and Community Affairs bonds to yield six percent in 2017. The 2028 maturity was not reoffered.</p>
<p>The preliminary pricing follows:  </p>
<p>TEXAS DEPARTMENT OF HOUSING AND COMMUNITY AFFAIRS</p>
<p>SINGLE FAMILY MORTGAGE REVENUE BONDS</p>
